        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In November 2022, we entered into Illumina, Inc.’s (“Illumina”) “open offer” supply agreement wherein Illumina provides products and services that we use in our laboratory operations for certain research and clinical activities, including certain sequencers, equipment, and other materials (the “Illumina Agreement”).",
        "start_character": 87682,
        "end_character": 87999
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In some instances, we have acquired or in-licensed patent rights developed by third parties to enhance our patent portfolio and competitive advantage.",
        "start_character": 82252,
        "end_character": 82402
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some of these companies may have substantially greater financial and other resources than we have, such as larger R&D staff and more established marketing and sales forces, or may operate in jurisdictions where lower standards of evidence are required to bring products to market.",
        "start_character": 74478,
        "end_character": 74758
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have optimized our systems to provide industry-leading reports, service, and turn-around-time, helping oncologists (1) navigate among therapies with potential benefit, (2) identify therapies that may not have been considered, (3) determine drugs with potential lack of benefit (avoiding unnecessary toxicities and costs), and (4) match patients to clinical trials.",
        "start_character": 69681,
        "end_character": 70048
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have spent the last 17 years developing and building our portfolio of comprehensive, proprietary molecular profiling solutions and generating what we believe to be one of the largest and most comprehensive multi-modal clinico-genomic datasets in oncology.",
        "start_character": 725,
        "end_character": 983
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We market our solutions to biopharma companies through a separate Biopharma Business Development team.",
        "start_character": 71695,
        "end_character": 71797
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide high quality, reliable molecular testing services for all stages of the drug development cycle and routine clinical use.",
        "start_character": 67078,
        "end_character": 67209
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We will continue to pursue intellectual property protection, whether developed in-house or via third parties, that we believe will advance our business objectives.",
        "start_character": 83841,
        "end_character": 84004
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Caris Infrastructure: We have a well-developed laboratory, R&D, and sales infrastructure that we believe is foundational to our business.",
        "start_character": 9117,
        "end_character": 9255
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Cell-surface proteins are key to antibody-based therapeutics, and we have developed our own cell surfacesome comprising a database of cell surface proteins detected by mass spectrometry.",
        "start_character": 55935,
        "end_character": 56121
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we are developing MGMTai, a predictive signature that will help oncologists assess a patient’s risk of developing brain metastases, and other signatures in development include pancreatic cancer response predictors, a predictor of response to checkpoint inhibitor therapy for lung cancer patients, and a predictor of response to platinum-based therapies for ovarian cancer patients.",
        "start_character": 65500,
        "end_character": 65894
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002019410-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002019410-26-000016-ffd054bc907153b8",
        "accession_number": "0002019410-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, based on our belief in the power of comprehensive profiling, we determined to pursue whole genome sequencing for certain of our assays that are under development.",
        "start_character": 41882,
        "end_character": 42053
